  "description": "What happens when a jaded superstar and a desperate flop idol are forced into the ultimate adult playground? Jesse has conquered the music industry but lost his passion, while Tae-Hui is a five-year veteran of an obscure group starving for a single taste of success. Their paths collide on the set of an outrageous, high-stakes erotic variety show where contestants must strip away their modesty to conquer five scandalous stages. With a single winner-takes-all prize on the line, neither idol can afford to back down from the show's increasingly raunchy challenges. But the more they try to outmaneuver each other under the flashing lights, the harder it becomes to hide their exploding chemistry from the viewfinder.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
